<?= flash_messages() ?>

<div class="card">
  <div class="card-body">
    <h4 class="card-title mb-1">Interest &amp; Penalty Accrual Restatement</h4>
    <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
      One-time catch-up for the move from cash-basis to accrual-basis income recognition. For interest, posts a
      single adjusting journal per affected loan: whatever's already earned (installments due by today, or any
      interest already collected early) moves from Deferred Interest Income into Interest Income now; whatever
      isn't earned yet moves back out of Interest Receivable so the ordinary accrual run books it fresh when its
      real due date arrives. For penalty, moves the full outstanding Deferred Penalty Income into Penalty Income
      for every loan with an uncollected charged penalty. Written Off loans are automatically skipped. Safe to run
      more than once: already-restated loans are skipped on a re-run.
    </p>

    <?php if ($summary['loan_count'] === 0 && $summary['penalty_loan_count'] === 0): ?>
      <div class="alert alert-success mb-0">Nothing to restate -- every Active/Current loan is already on the new accrual method, or has no outstanding interest/penalty.</div>
    <?php else: ?>
      <div class="row mb-3">
        <div class="col-md-3">
          <div class="border rounded p-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-muted small">Loans Affected (Interest)</div>
            <div class="fs-4 fw-bold"><?= (int) $summary['loan_count'] ?></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
          <div class="border rounded p-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-muted small">Interest to Recognize Now</div>
            <div class="fs-5"><?= format_money($summary['total_recognized']) ?></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
          <div class="border rounded p-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-muted small">Interest Reversed (Not Yet Earned)</div>
            <div class="fs-5"><?= format_money($summary['total_reversed']) ?></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
          <div class="border rounded p-3 text-center">
            <div class="text-muted small">Penalty to Recognize (<?= (int) $summary['penalty_loan_count'] ?> loan(s))</div>
            <div class="fs-5"><?= format_money($summary['total_penalty_recognized']) ?></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form method="post" action="<?= url('/accounting/interest-restatement/run') ?>" onsubmit="return confirm('Post the restatement now? This cannot be undone from this screen.');">
        <?= csrf_field() ?>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-warning"><i class="mdi mdi-clipboard-text"></i> Post Restatement</button>
      </form>
    <?php endif; ?>
  </div>
</div>
